# Scenario 'mail_timeout': receiving with a message the fake POP3 server never finishes answering properly for the ROM: the only mail is
# traces/net/mail_nohdr.eml (a message with a single "Subject: bare" header and no From/Date), the ROM asks TOP 1 0 and then waits for more.
# Nothing else happens for five minutes of communication time (00:00 -> 05:00 on the screen), then the ROM cuts the session with error
# 26-000 "タイムアウトにより通信が切断されました" and shows the usual end-of-communication screens. Starts from the state left by 'mail_send'
# (the outbox is empty). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# Scenario 'mail_receive': おくる/うけとる with six messages waiting on the fake POP3 server (traces/net/mail_*.eml: Japanese
# ISO-2022-JP, plain ASCII, game mail with X-Game-* headers, multipart with a base64 attachment, a 40-line mail, a header-poor mail).
# Dial, PPP, DNS, POP3 USER/PASS/STAT/LIST/RETR/DELE/QUIT (fake server with latency=2 frames), result screens.
# Starts from the state left by 'mail_send' (outbox empty). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot top_menu
tap A                        # top menu: メール
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu
tap A                        # おくる/うけとる
waitstable 60 max 300
shot send_receive_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot send_receive_2
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot password_saved
tap A                        # "0でつうしんをはじめる"
waitstable 60 max 300
shot connecting
wait 3000
shot w1
wait 3000
shot w2
wait 3000
shot w3
wait 3000
shot w4
wait 6000
shot w5
tap A
wait 600
shot w6
tap A
wait 600
shot w7
